  "title": "Arrow Reports 2nd Quarter Net Income of $10.8 Million, or $0.65 per Share, and Declares 3rd Quarter Dividend of $0.29 per Share",
  "summary": "GLENS FALLS, N.Y. (July 24, 2025) – Arrow Financial Corporation (NasdaqGS® – AROW) (\"Arrow\" or \"the Company\") announced financial results for the three-month period ended June 30, 2025. Reported net income for the second quarter of 2025 was $10.8 million and fully diluted earnings per share (\"EPS\") was $0.65, versus net income of $6.3 million and EPS of $0.38 for the first quarter of 2025. The Board of Directors of Arrow declared a quarterly cash...",
